From 9e8d2b18807f0bed001a44f698edbe4e2cbee73f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 24 Sep 2026 16:14:56 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Split public and admin into separate Vite entry points
 (admin.html#/login)

- Add admin.html + src/admin-main.tsx + AdminApp (HashRouter) for GitHub Pages
- Public app no longer contains admin routes; Admin buttons navigate to admin.html#/login
- Remove tsc-emitted stale src/**/*.js that Vite resolved ahead of .tsx; set noEmit
- Vite multi-page build config; CI verifies dist/index.html, dist/admin.html, assets, base path
- Friendly Firebase auth error messages
